---
// src/components/common/Footer.astro
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50/70 dark:bg-neutral-950 text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mt-auto transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8 sm:py-10 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 text-xs">
      <!-- Columna 1: Brand & Filosofía -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-3">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-neutral-950 dark:text-white font-semibold text-sm group focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded p-0.5"
        >
          <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded overflow-hidden border border-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700 bg-white flex-shrink-0">
            <img
              src="/logos/logo-icon.webp"
              alt="Silantro Labs"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
          <span>Silantro Tools</span>
        </a>
        <p class="max-w-md text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed text-xs">
          Suite de micro-herramientas estáticas desarrolladas por Silantro Labs. Cada algoritmo opera en la memoria volátil de tu navegador, garantizando privacidad absoluta y cero llamadas a servidores externos.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-500 pt-0.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-neutral-400 dark:bg-neutral-600"></span>
          <span>100% Client-Side • Cero persistencia • Sin rastreo</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna 2: Herramientas -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-2.5">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Herramientas
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <a
              href="/tools/qr-generator/"
              class="text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 hover:underline underline-offset-4 decoration-neutral-400 transition-colors font-medium flex items-center justify-between group focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded"
            >
              <span>Generador de QR</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">Activo</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li class="text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600 font-mono text-[11px]">
            [ Compresor de Fotos — Próximamente ]
          </li>
          <li class="text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600 font-mono text-[11px]">
            [ Limpiador de Texto / PDF — Próximamente ]
          </li>
          <li class="text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600 font-mono text-[11px]">
            [ Generador de Contraseñas — Próximamente ]
          </li>
          <li class="text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600 font-mono text-[11px]">
            [ Comparador de Textos — Próximamente ]
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna 3: Institucional -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-2.5">
        <p class="font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-200 uppercase tracking-wider">
          Institucional & Legal
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5">
          <li>
            <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              Acerca de Silantro Labs
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/privacy/" class="hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              Política de Privacidad
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/terms/" class="hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              Términos de Servicio
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/cookies/" class="hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              Política de Cookies
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/contact/" class="hover:text-neutral-950 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-neutral-900 dark:focus-visible:ring-white rounded">
              Contacto y Soporte
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 mt-8 pt-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-neutral-500 gap-2">
      <span>
        &copy; {currentYear} Silantro Labs. Software de utilidad pública y cómputo local.
      </span>
      <span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600">
        tools.silantrolabs.com
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
